    },
    {
      "id": "595daabd",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 离散系统的数学描述\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "da6d9a04",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 参数\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c366a539",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ">**系统**是一个将输入信号转换并产生输出信号的对象，或者**系统**的响应。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\n![2-1.jpg](attachment:2-1.jpg)\n\n</div>\n\n>**线性时不变离散时间系统（LTIDS）**是指同时具有线性与时不变性特性的系统。若系统输出是输入信号和输出信号采样值的线性组合（包括那些在时间上存在延迟的采样值），则该系统被称为**线性**。如果系统的响应不随时间变化，则该系统称为**时不变**。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2-1.jpg": {
          "image/jpeg": "data:image/jpeg;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d08fc1ed",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 差分方程\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dbec1f9f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**差分方程**展示了如何根据输入信号的当前样本和延迟样本，以及输出信号的延迟样本，求得输出信号的当前值：\n\n$$\\sum_{k=0}^N a_ky(n-k)=\\sum_{m=0}^M b_mx(n-m),\n$$\n\n其中$x$是输入信号，$y$是输出信号，$a_k$和$b_k$是权重系数。\n\nLTIDS的系数以向量形式表示：\n\n$$a=[a_0, a_1, ..., a_N],\n$$\n\n$$b=[b_0, b_1, ..., b_M].\n$$\n\n一个差分方程的示例：\n\n$$y(n)+0,2y(n-1)+0,1y(n-2)=0,75x(n)+0,5x(n-1).\n$$\n\n让我们据此推导出输出信号的当前值：\n\n$$y(n)=-0,2y(n-1)-0,1y(n-2)+0,75x(n)+0,5x(n-1).\n$$\n\n此处的系数向量形式如下：\n\n$$a=[\\begin{matrix} 1 & 0,2 & 0,1 \\end{matrix}],\n$$\n\n$$b=[\\begin{matrix} 0,75 & 0,5 \\end{matrix}].\n$$\n\n该差分方程可以示意图表示如下：\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\n![схема для разностного уравнения.jpg](attachment:схема для разностного уравнения.jpg)\n\n</div>\n\n其中，符号$z^{-1}$表示一个采样（一个时钟周期）的信号延迟；带数字的三角形表示将采样值与相应的系数相乘；圆圈内的符号$+$表示加法器。\n\n利用差分方程，可以设计LTIDS方案并将其实现为硬件。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "схема для разностного уравнения.jpg": {
          "image": "data:image/jpeg;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f001f73",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 冲激响应\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7b0a59a0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ">**冲激响应**是LTIDS系统对单位离散脉冲的响应。 \n\n单位离散脉冲是离散信号中狄拉克δ函数的对应概念；它仅有一个采样值，在时间$t=0$处等于$1$。\n\n系统响应$y(n)$可通过输入信号$x(n)$与脉冲响应$h(n)$的离散卷积计算得出：\n$$y(n)=x(n)*h(n).$$\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "36fac743",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Z变换。传递函数\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dd33ad44",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ">**Z变换**将时域中的信号值映射到复数频域中的采样点：\n> $$X(z)=\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}x(n)z^{-n}.$$\n\n在Z域中，计算变得更加简单且高效。因此，复杂系统通常在Z域中进行分析，随后通过逆变换回到时域。\n\n系统输出信号的Z变换可通过输入信号与冲激响应的Z变换之积来计算：\n$$y(n)=x(n)*h(n) \\rightarrow Y(z)=X(z) \\cdot H(z).$$\n\n> Z域中输出与输入的比值称为系统的**传递函数**：\n> $$H(z)=\\frac{Y(z)}{X(z)}.$$\n\n这是一个分母和分子中都包含多项式的有理函数：\n$$H(z)=\\frac{b_0+b_1z^{-1}+b_2z^{-2}+...+b_Mz^{-M}}{a_0+a_1z^{-1}+a_2z^{-2}+...+a_Nz^{-N}}.$$\n这些多项式完全由差分方程的系数决定。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c9e9efc7",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 作为滤波器的线性时不变系统\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bf04ecb6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "> 线性时不变系统的目的是改变输入信号的振幅和/或相位。这一过程称为**滤波**。 \n\n例如，线性时不变系统的一项典型任务是从信号中去除不需要的高频分量，并放大有用的低频分量。\n\n此外，我们将此类系统称为**滤波器**。 \n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\n![2-2.jpg](attachment:2-2.jpg)\n\n</div>\n\n要描述任何滤波器，只需知道其两个系数向量即可：\n\n$$b=[\\begin{matrix} b_0& b_1 & ... & b_M \\end{matrix}],$$\n$$a=[\\begin{matrix} a_0 & a_1 & ... & a_N \\end{matrix}].$$\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2-2.jpg": {
          "image/jpeg": "data:image/jpeg;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c06c584a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##  **中的离散模型AnyMath**\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64f12626",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "用于仿真离散系统的主要模块是 **Unit Delay** 模块。它位于 **Basic** -> **Discrete** 库中。\n\n<center>\n\n![2-3.png](attachment:2-3.png)\n\n</center>\n\n该模块将信号延迟一个采样步长。换言之，在第 $n$ 个时间步，它输出前一个信号值 $x(n-1)$。\n\n该模块具有两个参数：\n\n<center>\n\n![2-4.png](attachment:2-4.png)\n\n</center>\n\n* **Initial condition** - 指定仿真第一个时间步时模块的输出值，因为在 $n=1$ 时状态 $x(n-1)$ 的值尚不存在。\n* **Sample Time** - 输入信号将被延迟的时间。默认值为 `-1`（采样时间从输入信号继承）。\n\n使用 **Unit Delay** 模块，您可以对许多具有离散状态的系统进行建模，例如数字滤波器、控制器和其他信号处理算法。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2-3.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "2-4.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ddba7ed5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 使用基本模块仿真离散时间系统\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ed85f4a4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在本节中，您将对由以下差分方程描述的离散时间系统进行建模：\n\n$$y(n)=0.16x(n)+0.38x(n-1)+0.38x(n-2)+0.16x(n-3).$$\n\n通过Z变换得到的该系统的传递函数为：\n\n$$H(z)=0.16+0.38z^{-1}+0.38z^{-2}+0.16z^{-3}.$$\n\n该线性系统是一个低通滤波器。\n\n作为输入信号，您将使用一个频率随时间线性变化的正弦波（通过**Chirp** 模块进行仿真）。\n\n对于输入信号$x$，最大延迟为$3$；而对于输出信号$y$，最大延迟为$0$。因此，所需的 **Unit Delay** 模块数量为$3$。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "38e24f55",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务1\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "82303f36",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "对线性系统的输入信号及其延迟副本进行建模：\n\n1. 创建一个新模型。向模型中添加一个 **Chirp** 模块。该模块位于 **Signal Processing** -> **Sources** 库中。\n2. 在模块设置窗口中，将参数值设置为图中所示：\n\n<center>\n\n![2-5.png](attachment:2-5.png)\n\n</center>\n\n3. 向模型中添加三个 **Unit Delay** 模块。将这些模块向右旋转 $90^\\circ$。将 **Chirp** 模块的输出连接到第一个 **Unit Delay** 模块的输入；其余模块依次串联。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n<center>\n\n![2-6.png](attachment:2-6.png)\n\n</center>\n\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2-5.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "2-6.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b6af3bde",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务2\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1a461dfd",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "现在需要将原始信号及其延迟副本分别乘以相应的系数：\n\n1. 在模型中添加四个 **Gain** 模块。该模块位于 **Basic** -> **Math Operations** 库中。将这些模块从上到下排列。\n2. 在模块设置窗口中，将参数 **Gain** 的值分别设置为 `0.16`、`0.38`、`0.38` 和 `0.16`。\n3. 将第一个 **Gain** 模块的输入连接到 **Chirp** 模块的输出。将第二个 **Gain** 模块的输入连接到第一个 **Unit Delay** 模块的输出。将第三个 **Gain** 模块的输入连接到第二个 **Unit Delay** 模块的输出。将第四个 **Gain** 模块的输入连接到第三个 **Unit Delay** 模块的输出（必要时从已有连线创建分支）。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n<center>\n\n![2-7.png](attachment:2-7.png)\n\n</center>\n\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2-7.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d6318c92",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务3\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4962c31d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "根据差分方程，输出信号等于输入信号及其延迟副本乘以相应系数后的和。因此，来自所有 **Gain** 模块的输出信号必须相加。\n\n完成该模型：\n\n1. 在模型中添加一个 **Add** 模块。该模块位于 **Basic** -> **Math Operations** 库中。\n2. 在模块设置窗口中，将 **List of Signs** 参数的值设置为 `++++`。此时，该模块将拥有 $4$ 个输入端口，这些端口的信号会相加。\n3. 将四个 **Gain** 模块的输出端口连接到 **Add** 模块的输入端口。\n4. 在模型中添加一个 **Terminator** 模块，并将其连接到 **Add** 模块的输出端。\n5. 记录 **Chirp** 模块的输出（线性系统的输入信号）以及 **Add** 模块的输出（线性系统的输出信号）。\n6. 在模型设置窗口中，将仿真时间设置为 `8` 秒，将固定步长设置为 `1/8000`。\n7. 运行模型。在同一画布上先绘制线性系统输入信号和输出信号的时域图，再绘制频域图。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![2-8.png](attachment:2-8.png)\n\n</center>\n\n输入和输出信号的时域图：\n\n<center>\n\n![2-9.png](attachment:2-9.png)\n\n</center>\n\n输入和输出信号的频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![2-10.png](attachment:2-10.png)\n\n</center>\n\n图表显示，输出信号的振幅随频率增加而减小。这意味着该系统起到低通滤波器的作用，降低了信号中高频分量的功率。\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2-8.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "2-9.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "2-10.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
