    {
      "id": "572c8333",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 显示模块的采样率\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f8230dc9",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在 **Unit Delay**、**Gain** 和 **Add** 模块中，采样率由这些模块的输入信号继承；也就是说，它们等于 **Chirp** 模块的采样率。\n\n这些模块的采样率可直接在模型中显示。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d6f078fb",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务5\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "847f3e17",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在上一任务中创建的模型中显示采样率：\n\n1. 在模型设置窗口的**Debugging** 选项卡下，**Information display** 部分，选择**Signal sampling rate**以及**Highlighting**。\n\n<center>\n\n![2-11.png](attachment:2-11.png)\n\n</center>\n\n2. 将鼠标指针悬停在模型中任意信号线上的`D1`符号上。采样率值（`1.2500e-4`）将显示在弹出窗口中。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解决方案</span></h5>\" %}\n\n<center>\n\n![2-12.png](attachment:2-12.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2-11.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "2-12.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1490cd5a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 多通道信号处理\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb739477",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**AnyMath** 支持对 **多通道信号** 进行数字处理。多通道信号以矩阵形式表示，其中每一列都是独立信号。这些信号可能来自不同的信息源或通道（例如不同时间点的温度、压力、风速）。\n\n在接下来的任务中，您将使用低通滤波器同时处理三个独立信号：啁啾信号、正弦波和语音信号。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "52ae0013",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务6\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edbca632",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "修改上一任务中构建的模型：\n\n1. 删除连接 **Chirp** 模块与模型其余部分的连线。\n\n2. 向模型中添加以下模块：**DSP Sine Wave**、**From Multimedia File** 和 **Matrix Concatenate**。\n\n3. 在模块设置窗口中，将参数值设置为如下图所示。\n\n**DSP Sine Wave** 模块：\n\n<center>\n\n![2-13.png](attachment:2-13.png)\n\n</center>\n\n**Matrix Concatenate** 模块：\n\n<center>\n\n![2-14.png](attachment:2-14.png)\n\n</center>\n\n**From Multimedia File** 模块：将 **File name** 参数的值设置为 `Signal3.wav`。\n\n4. 如下图所示连接各模块：\n\n<center>\n\n![2-15.png](attachment:2-15_2.png)\n\n</center>\n\n将 **Matrix Concatenate** 模块的输出信号连接到线性系统的输入端，并记录该信号。\n\n5. 运行模型。绘制多通道输入信号在时域和频域中的图形，并绘制线性系统输出信号在频域中的图形。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![2-16.png](attachment:2-16_2.png)\n\n</center>\n\n输入信号的时域图：\n\n<center>\n\n![2-17.png](attachment:2-17.png)\n\n</center>\n\n输入信号的频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![2-18.png](attachment:2-18.png)\n\n</center>\n\n输出信号的频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![2-19.png](attachment:2-19.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "2-13.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
